                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "74d04981-7543-3d4b-8392-e4ddd0224e8d",
                        "entry_id": "d538435d-91aa-3ae4-9321-10685fa22210",
                        "glosses": [
                            "volledig gebrek aan schaamte (over iets waarover men zich eigenlijk wel zou moeten schamen)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa097448-8c6f-4610-bb91-b2d1ae8b9507",
                                "sense_id": "74d04981-7543-3d4b-8392-e4ddd0224e8d",
                                "text": "Marja Dmitrijevna was bekend bij de keizerlijke familie, heel Moskou en Petersburg kenden haar, en hoewel de mensen in beide steden haar bewonderden, werd er heimelijk gelachen om haar ongegeneerdheid en deden er grappen over haar de ronde; maar desalniettemin werd zij algemeen gerespecteerd en gevreesd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7f718ae-0083-452c-b51b-9981e6b052c0",
                                "sense_id": "74d04981-7543-3d4b-8392-e4ddd0224e8d",
                                "text": "Van Jeroen Willems heb ik geleerd dat je als acteur een bepaalde mate van ongegeneerdheid moet hebben. Ik durf niet zo stellig te zijn. Ik verstop me liever in een rol. Maar het is goed om te twijfelen, hoewel dat in mijn geval soms echt gênant kan zijn."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c5d9eb75-8811-3498-9965-5ed562bb03b0",
                        "entry_id": "d538435d-91aa-3ae4-9321-10685fa22210",
                        "glosses": [
                            "beschamende handelwijze"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6e0a2e2-bb31-4906-b5e2-470ab782af18",
                                "sense_id": "c5d9eb75-8811-3498-9965-5ed562bb03b0",
                                "text": "Geplaatst voor het Franse voorstel om België voor 20 miljard Euro compensaties aan te bieden als onze F16's zou vervangen worden door de Rafale, heeft de Minister van Landsverdediging geoordeeld dat dit aanbod \"te mooi om waar te zijn\" is. Deze ongegeneerdheid laat volgens mij een gebrek aan elegantie en respect zien tegenover onze Franse partners."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7f353023-de63-47d2-aeb3-7e06855ae12d",
                        "source_entry_id": "d538435d-91aa-3ae4-9321-10685fa22210",
                        "source_sense_id": "74d04981-7543-3d4b-8392-e4ddd0224e8d",
                        "source_sense_description": "volledig gebrek aan schaamte (over iets waarover men zich eigenlijk wel zou moeten schamen)",
                        "target_lang_word": "abandonment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "abandonment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "387e8c2e-b4ee-3f9c-be56-38d361fb89ec",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of abandoning, or the state of being abandoned; total desertion; relinquishment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fa719ab-5271-46e7-ade5-a9eb3c3aef87",
                                                "sense_id": "387e8c2e-b4ee-3f9c-be56-38d361fb89ec",
                                                "text": "To what are we reserved? An adequate compensation \"for the sacrifice of powers the most nearly connected with us;\"— an adequate compensation \"for the direct or indirect annexation to France ot all the ports of the continent, from Dunkirk to Hamburgh;\"— an adequate compensation \"for the abandonment of the independence of Europe!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b7e40fd-aef0-4390-abd2-1d0a6f95f718",
                                                "sense_id": "387e8c2e-b4ee-3f9c-be56-38d361fb89ec",
                                                "text": "The fate of the railway from Ballater to Braemar has been invested with an air of mystery, which has never been completely dispelled. It has been suggested that Queen Victoria was opposed to a railway in the vicinity of Balmoral Castle, and intervened personally to secure the abandonment of the line beyond Ballater."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5c9050d-c102-3cb3-8504-76dfc9dcafa0",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The voluntary leaving of a person to whom one is bound by a special relation, as a wife, husband or child; desertion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67d017e9-a706-4b96-9601-46763dae8590",
                                                "sense_id": "c5c9050d-c102-3cb3-8504-76dfc9dcafa0",
                                                "text": "Since he left her, she's suing him for divorce on grounds of abandonment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86e5df2b-2a14-3795-aabd-43a7bcca99a4",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An abandoned building or structure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16636c93-5a54-4033-a057-60842d6e38b2",
                                                "sense_id": "86e5df2b-2a14-3795-aabd-43a7bcca99a4",
                                                "text": "High-profile abandonments are harder to infiltrate for urban explorers due to their heightened security."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c7d6cfc-0063-387d-a8d4-42443450da10",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The relinquishment of a right, claim, or privilege; relinquishment of right to secure a patent by an inventor; relinquishment of copyright by an author."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e524543-0873-3d50-8735-ae097b2c7993",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The relinquishment by the insured to the underwriters of what may remain of the property insured after a loss or damage by a peril insured against."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28c95c66-232f-3ff3-a2b6-847a888def69",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The cessation of service on a particular segment of the lines of a common carrier, as granted by a government agency."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0d8f4f3-a11a-436b-b74d-3099425158af",
                                                "sense_id": "28c95c66-232f-3ff3-a2b6-847a888def69",
                                                "text": "The railway was in fact shifted in 1937 a little to the west, over a distance of a quarter-mile, to make room for the by-pass at this point, but complete abandonment was firmly vetoed because of the proved strategic value of the line."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "996d43ff-4c96-3888-b382-94309b85212b",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A refusal to receive freight so damaged in transit as to be worthless and render carrier liable for its value."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f40a0a61-3aef-3306-b2ec-6e2bcbce9045",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The self-surrender to an outside influence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf982cbd-0529-3876-aa93-2fc089611383",
                                        "entry_id": "8f59ad6f-1cfe-3a83-8be1-61afbad1f6e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abandon; careless freedom or ease; surrender to one's emotions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8018921-cda5-49e5-9e06-060a94b8c57a",
                                                "sense_id": "cf982cbd-0529-3876-aa93-2fc089611383",
                                                "text": "Roger, in terms of the strengths he brought to the band, was wild abandonment. So if Howard was in the pocket, Roger was bouncing off the walls, and Nancy was somewhere in the middle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
